@Comment:	Authored controls for first and repeated scoped annotation positions, payloads and order; not derived from a recording.
@Comment:	Alternatives are not replacements; overlaps have paired speakers and retraces have following spoken repairs.
*CHI:	bird [=? lark] [% guess] .
